              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta jambo na rimwe mu yo Mose yageze yose, Yosuwa atāsomeye imbere y’ikoraniro ry’Abisirayeli ryose, hamwe n’abagore n’abana n’abanyamahanga bāgendana na bo.",
